Usage
-----

To use this library in your project, add it to your ols.json collections:

    {
        "collections": [
            {
                "name": "{name}",
                "path": "path/to/{name}"
            }
        ]
    }

Then import it in your code:

    import "{name}"

Development
-----------

Run checks:

    make check

Run tests:

    make test

Generate documentation:

    make doc

Run the example:

    make example
